& [DecisionProof] is requirement-based
  + [unmet_current_storage_requirement] is none demonstrated
  + [JSON] is smallest final artifact and fastest reconstruction at every measured scale
  + [SQLite] is operationally valuable but has no present measured advantage for the immutable whole-environment startup workload
  + [redb] is operationally viable but has no present measured advantage and a substantial small-corpus allocation floor
  + [selection] is retain JSON snapshot and in-memory fabric
  + [production_dependency_change] is none
  + [trust_bootstrap] is unchanged and remains operator-supervised outside every physical candidate

